00:12:50.920 --> 00:12:55.660
what the Mr Sinister tease means for Wolverine
3 and other X-Men movies, or for more easter

00:12:55.660 --> 00:12:59.779
eggs you could check out my video of all the
easter eggs and references from Captain America

00:12:59.779 --> 00:13:01.070
Civil War.

00:13:01.070 --> 00:13:03.140
Click any of the links here to check those
out.

00:13:03.140 --> 00:13:05.380
Thanks for watching and see you next time!

